      "title": "Get application properties",
      "description": "Get candidate property values for a candidate's job via authenticated GET /candidates/{id}/jobs/{jobId}/properties. OAuth scope candidates_read (declared per operation; not part of the default connect set). API keys need the matching SmartRecruiters user permission.",
      "inputSchema": {
